--- !u!114 &910040003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 910040001}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3789010abcdef0000000000000000009, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlantingHierarchyGuide
  hierarchyNotes: "TRONG CAY / CHAU (Town demo)\r\n\r\n------ Item Data ------\r\nCreate
    > The Dreams/Inventory/Seed  -> SeedItemData (chi de trong)\r\nCreate > The Dreams/Inventory/Pot  
    -> PotItemData (chi de dat chau)\r\nItem_EmptyPot: PotItemData + gan potPrefab
    = Prefab PlantBed_Pot\r\nItem_TomatoSeed: SeedItemData + gan growthStages (TomatoPlant_0..4)\r\n\r\n------
    Prefab PlantBed ------\r\nPlantBed_Soil / PlantBed_Pot\r\n  SpriteRenderer (dat/chau)\r\n 
    BoxCollider2D IsTrigger ~ 1.2 x 1.2\r\n  PlantBed.cs\r\n    kind = Soil | Pot\r\n   
    bedId (unique trong scene)\r\n  PlantVisual (child, tu tao neu thieu)\r\n\r\n------
    Snap dat chau ------\r\nPutSnap_1  [Empty + PutSnapPoint]\r\n  accepts = Pot\r\n 
    Gizmo hinh tron xanh = trong\r\n\r\n------ Player ------\r\nThem ItemPut.cs (PlantingDemoSetup
    tu them)\r\n  F + chon Pot trong inventory  -> snap dat chau\r\n  F + chon Seed                
    -> trong vao bed gan nhat\r\n  E dung gan PlantBed + chon Seed -> trong\r\n\r\n------
    Demo Town ------\r\nObject: ------ Planting Demo ------\r\n  PlantingHierarchyGuide\r\n 
    PlantingDemoSetup  (Play mode spawn snap/soil/pickup neu thieu)\r\n\r\n------
    Choi thu ------\r\n1. Nhat Empty Pot / Tomato Seed (E)\r\n2. Mo Inv, click chon
    item\r\n3. Dung gan PutSnap, bam F de dat chau\r\n4. Chon Seed, bam F (hoac E
    gan bed) de trong\r\n5. Bam N (demo) de +1 ngay, xem cay lon\r\n6. Save/Load
    de kiem tra PlantWorld + lich\r\n\r\n------ LifeTime ------\r\nNgay / Thang /
    Nam thu 1, 2, ... (khong dung nam duong lich)\r\nHet 24:00 -> sang ngay moi.
    Cay tinh theo AbsoluteDay.\r\nUI LifeTimePanel: DayText, MonthText, YearText,
    TimeText."
